WEBVTT

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.230
I'm going to get there early today!

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.730
Katakura-san!

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:53.730
What?

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.040
I have a bad feeling...

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.990
Yuzuyu-chan disappeared!

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.630
What?!  Again?!

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:07.270
She said she was going to go home alone and when I took my eyes off of her for just a second...

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:10.360
Why?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.800
Kippei-onii-chan.

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:24.380
Never mind.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:10.510
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.460
This is the Katakura residence.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.780
Mom, is Yuzuyu there?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.250
Kippei?

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:21.190
Yuzuyu-chan isn't home yet.

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:22.760
Isn't she with you?

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.300
It seems that she went home by herself.

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:27.430
What?!

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:30.020
Anyway, I'm going to try to find her.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:50.690
Yuzu!

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.810
It's hot.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.450
Water!

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.970
Wow!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:24.500
W-Wow!

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.160
Puppy!

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.180
Where are you going?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:58.990
Wait!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.130
Hey,where are you going?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:18.860
Wait!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:20.850
That's dangerous.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.790
You're going to get run over by a car.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.300
You're so small.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.970
You're so cute, Pekki.

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:37.890
Where's your mother?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:46.050
Want me to find her for you?

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:51.490
Yuzuyu!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.390
What is it?

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:00.870
I'm sorry.  Wrong person.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.370
It's no good.  I've looked around the neighborhood, but I can't find her.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.340
It's going to get dark soon.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.860
I wonder what happened.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:17.420
Maybe she was kidnapped?!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.200
Dear, please calm down.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.760
I'm going to look a little further away.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.860
If you find her, please give me a call!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.520
Let's all go look for her.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:30.540
Yes, I agree.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.470
Mom, you stay home.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.550
Then, please take Yuzuyu-chan's jacket with you.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.150
The sun is going down and it's getting cooler, so...

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.070
If something happens, I'll let you know.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:43.770
Something?

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.820
It'll be okay.

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:49.030
If I can't find her, I'll call police officers Masaki and Kouji.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.490
Who are Masaki and Kouji?

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:23.960
Excuse me...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.400
Have you seen a girl about this tall today?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.270
That hurt!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:39.310
Kokoro-chan...

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:41.620
You're angry.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:43.470
I'm sorry.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.120
Are you okay?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.170
Don't suddenly run into me like that.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:50.830
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:58.190
What?

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:01.760
What is it?

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:06.410
Yuzuyu disappeared.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.240
Why?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:12.530
I don't know.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.060
Anyway, I'm going to continue looking for her.

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.960
Want me to look for her too?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.730
Really?  If you find her, give me a call on my cell!

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.700
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.320
You're early today!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.300
Want to go to the park on the way home?

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:43.100
Yeah!

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:05.830
Kippei-onii-chan is very good at playing in the sandbox.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.050
Kokoro-onee-chan...

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.880
do you like Kippei-onii-chan?

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.090
You're starting to get heavy, Pekki.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:53.160
Let's rest for a little while.  My hands are tired.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:59.320
I don't really know where your home is...

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.860
What is it?  Are you hungry?

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:12.250
Pekki, do you want to eat a leaf?

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.070
I didn't think so.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.810
It's already night time.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:23.720
What am I going to do?

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:39.940
Shinjirou?

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.370
It really is you!

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:51.090
Oh, I'm so glad!  I thought I would never find you...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.200
And you are?

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.550
Did you rescue him?

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.250
Where do you live?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:05.040
Wait a minute!  Where are you going?

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.620
Bye bye, Pekki.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:28.850
Where am I?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:43.050
Kippei-onii-chan.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.190
Nee-chan!

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:09.620
Kippei, did you find her?

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:10.690
Not yet.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:12.480
Why don't you try calling Mom?

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.540
I called her earlier, but she said Yuzuyu hasn't come home yet.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.460
She'll give us a call if she comes home.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.290
I see...

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:24.460
I guess I should report it to Masaki and Kouji after all.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:26.870
I'm going to go find her.

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:32.350
Kippei!

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:36.070
Take this.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.680
It's Yuzuyu-chan's jacket.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:39.340
It's getting cold, so...

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:42.610
Thanks.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:04.990
Yuzuyu!

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.670
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:08.670
Yuzuyu...

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:39.540
You...

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.520
What are you doing here?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.010
D-dumplings...

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:56.370
Dumplings.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.580
I-I see.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.850
Anyhow, everyone's worried.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:13.560
Let's go.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:33.350
I can go home by myself.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:34.920
Why?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:36.790
What's wrong?

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:42.740
I don't need lunch either.

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:07.050
No.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:10.730
I'll do it.

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.650
I've only been making mistakes lately,

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:17.600
so I know why you're angry,

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:20.070
but I'll do it properly from now on.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:25.050
Let me try my best.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.030
Here, put this on.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:53.940
Actually, I really wanted you to make me lunch and pick me up from school.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:17:04.010
I really didn't like that Kokoro-onee-chan came to my preschool!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:11.000
I really liked it better when it was just the two of us!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:16.540
Yuzuyu...

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.010
I'm sorry.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:21.020
Is she asleep?

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:22.820
Yeah.

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:28.450
Yuzuyu-chan was already left by her mother,

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:32.000
and right now she's trying desperately to make you not hate her.

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:33.220
All the time.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:48.400
I really liked it better when it was just the two of us!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.350
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:26.570
Kokoro-chan.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:35.000
I think I still have to watch Yuzuyu closely.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.570
She's still very little.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.550
I think so too.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.590
I'll be okay without you...

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:53.240
I'm grown up, and I have friends.

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.450
Can we still kiss and stuff sometimes?!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.380
Go to hell.  What's that about?

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:08.120
Kokoro, there's a really interesting magazine!  Come look!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:09.200
Okay.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.280
What are you two talking about?

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:13.300
Nothing in particular.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:14.270
Bye.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.290
Yuzuyu-chan!  You're being picked up.

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.180
What's that about?  Is she embarrassed?

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.020
That's interesting.

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:50.850
Yuzuyu-chan, hurry up!  I'm going to leave without you!

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.210
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:05.140
For now, stay close...

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:11.740
Katakura-san, what are you doing?

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:19.540
So bored...

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:20.960
Let's go karaoke!

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:22.070
That sounds good.

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:23.880
You're going too, right, Kokoro?

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:28.590
What's wrong?  You seem down.

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:29.900
It's always the same.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.490
That's so boring.

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:34.700
It's okay for Kokoro.

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:36.430
What's with that?

00:23:52.230 --> 00:23:54.570
Kokoro?  What are you looking at?

00:23:56.130 --> 00:23:56.930
It's nothing.

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.620
Ah, Kokoro!

00:24:19.780 --> 00:24:21.370
I don't want to.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:24.840
Yuzuyu-chan, even if it's not a school day and you're not with Kippei,

00:24:25.050 --> 00:24:27.030
you still have to eat properly, okay?

00:24:27.490 --> 00:24:31.410
Lunch?  I thought of something good!

00:24:31.590 --> 00:24:32.360
What is it?

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:33.390
It's...

00:24:34.760 --> 00:24:36.890
That is a plan to get excited about!

00:24:37.340 --> 00:24:38.180
Should we try it?

00:24:39.280 --> 00:24:41.190
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:41.680 --> 00:24:42.790
Yuzu's Errand

00:24:44.590 --> 00:24:46.850
I'm so excited!
